      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Welcome to the Nifty League NFTL BURNER!

    Are you ready to commit
    your NFTL to the fiery innards of Rugman''s Peak?

    Burn enough and you can
    get to the TOP 10 LEADERBOARD!


    Step 1. Click on ''CONNECT WALLET'' to connect
    your crypto wallet.


    Step 2. Type in how much NFTL you''d like to burn in
    the field below ''NFTL TO BURN''


    Step 3. Click the big BURN! button to
    burn your NFTL


    Step 4. Enjoy the animation of the DEGEN releasing NFTL
    into the gaping maw of Rugman''s Peak.


    Step 5. If you crack the LEADERBOARD
    you''ll be prompted to type your name to be displayed in the TOP 10.


    Step
    6. You can burn more NFTL if you like! Any amounts will be added to the wallet''s
    overall burned amount to determine leaderboard rankings.


    *Please Note:
    there is a GAS fee for every burn.


    Your NFTL will be added to the global
    NFTL amount burned!'
